{"unit_id":"Nana7mi0721__dsh-comfyui-agent#feature-1","repo":"Nana7mi0721/dsh-comfyui-agent","commit":"2f12ad14b35a74bc4508354c5e6dad520a216c9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-comfyui-agent 的功能「查询节点」：按关键词查找 ComfyUI 节点类，或查看指定节点的输入定义。通过 comfyui_nodes 工具触发，返回节点列表或该类的输入、输出和分类信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:201-240"]}
{"unit_id":"Nana7mi0721__dsh-comfyui-agent#feature-2","repo":"Nana7mi0721/dsh-comfyui-agent","commit":"2f12ad14b35a74bc4508354c5e6dad520a216c9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-comfyui-agent 的功能「浏览画布工作流」：列出本机保存的工作流，并查看单个工作流的可调参数或 API 格式。通过 comfyui_workflows 工具选择 list、params 或 get 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:243-260","lib/tools.js:297-336"]}
{"unit_id":"Nana7mi0721__dsh-comfyui-agent#feature-3","repo":"Nana7mi0721/dsh-comfyui-agent","commit":"2f12ad14b35a74bc4508354c5e6dad520a216c9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-comfyui-agent 的功能「运行工作流」：用 comfyui_run 提交已保存画布、内置 txt2img/img2img 模板或直接提供的 API 工作流，可覆盖节点输入，并同步等待图片结果或稍后恢复任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:338-354","lib/tools.js:525-585"]}
